{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/6203","id":5273478798,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTrgxoM8AAAABOlLmjg","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/6203","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/6203.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/6203.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/issues/6203","number":6203,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(eval): keep incomplete negative evidence out of NoUpdate (HOLD)","user":{"login":"ProfHepta","id":102159240,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhbTiA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102159240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta","html_url":"https://github.com/ProfHepta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 当前证据检查点：维护与最终格式化已闭合，b608 候选待完整验收\n\n本 PR 处理证据不足被误写成比较结论、原 owner 到实际消费者的接线，以及恢复证据缺口。本轮把已审源码与实际执行收据连接起来，固定了可供后续原验收检查的确切候选。\n\n**真实合格任务链仍为 0，qualification=false，PR 保持 draft。** 源分支仍为 `cc57c7198db6293ccca562253c42fffbe2a04633`；已实际创建并完整读回的新候选是 `b6084394a4a38ab495c16eaba09e879f04a96f8e`，tree `8ebb37e523ad3932a58cf016af0a9f4e0eeb6638`，sole parent `d25675445c39f76db69a7bd8e71a1a72e1cd5b9f`。\n\n### 已完成并核实\n\n| 项目 | 实际结果 | 结论范围 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 41e 原维护 | 原 scoped `just fix` 与原 `just fmt` 均正常退出 0，17 个实际 Rust 变更 | 独立 changed-source 合同；不会改写历史 fix101 失败 |\n| 50f 最终应用与格式化 | 四个已审 non-Rust 注册/契约文件完整应用；原 fmt 退出 0，未再修改源码 | HEAD/index 在该窗口仍为 d256/a489；物理树为 8ebb |\n| 完整源码 | 15,243 个文件；全部四项前后像、15,239 项不变行和 mode-aware tree 一致 | 完整原库存和大转移包按实际 raw/gzip/全部分片身份恢复；没有声称第二次 native 全库读取 |\n| 运行收据 | Root 重放 49 份原读取 SDK、46 个固定路径，38 条只读命令全 0，28 项输入不变，三项最终审计通过 | 210 项 producer 清单不被解释成 210 项均单独外部下载 |\n| 最终候选 | b608 原 commit、21 blobs、7 trees 均可获取并核身份 | 提交、静态审查和格式化结果不构成本版本 source/native 或真实效用通过 |\n\n四个最终应用文件刷新 CALLERS、精确 allowlist 项和源码契约摘要/范围；原安全边界、负向用例、owner/capability 门槛保持。最后格式化的空变化包另有独立完整字节审查。\n\n### 下一验收边界\n\n精确 canonical 请求使用原四输入 bootstrap 和原驱动；仅固定路径/身份常量改变，46 个顶层函数及其嵌套定义逐字保留，原 600/180/900 秒预算保持。它只对齐 Git objects/index/HEAD，不写物理源码、不运行测试、不安装依赖、不移动远程 ref。该检查点包含准备和精确审查，**不包含 canonical 执行或后续 source/native 资格结果**。\n\nQualification admission 正在落实明确的证据桥接：3bb 起点与实际 canonical 终点分开；保留含 uid/gid 的完整元数据，再按原 V5 字段/DFS 顺序投影；历史 V8 ENV 与实际恢复 inode 分开；原 12 source pins 只对当前 workflow 做唯一显式覆盖，其余 11 不变。原 14 phases、包/filters/预算，以及 **48 个 exact Root FQN/JUnit 名称**均保留；skip 不算通过。\n\n普通启动路径仍在学习输入前降权，已审范围内的新 API 仍缺普通产品调用者。现有同进程 Current/journal 恢复用例不等于真实 daemon/Root 进程冷恢复。最终仍需 **真实授权 A → 原 Training owner → 独立 B → Adopt 或完整 NoUpdate → 新消费者 C → daemon 与 Root 冷恢复**，并冻结完整部署组合、成本与独立性证据。\n\n缺结果、成本、材料、来源、独立性或原 owner 授权保持 **InsufficientEvidence/Unknown**；完整不采用比较和可复现的确定性欺诈分别保留自己的语义。工程审批 JSON 不构成 Hepta 运行时授权。\n\n完整证据与原始材料：[本次证据索引](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/blob/012066007240146d41bc2e1609aec965c411ae2b/qa/evidence/utility-evaluation-20261112-36fa/README.md)。此前较长 PR 记录已逐字保留：[d553 后原 PR 文本](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/blob/012066007240146d41bc2e1609aec965c411ae2b/qa/evidence/utility-evaluation-20261112-36fa/publication-post-d553/PR_6203_BODY_POST_D553.md)。\n","created_at":"2026-11-12T07:36:52Z","updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:07:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":nul